hadiths[25]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2069","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne dua ki ke Ae Allah ! Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki aal ki rozi zaroorat ke muwafiq rakhna"
"2070","[AI-translation] ´Urwa Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat kartay hain ke wo kaha karti thin ke` Allah ki qasam Ae mere bhaanjay ! ham aik chaand dekhtay doosra dekhtay teesra dekhtay do maheena mein teen chaand dekhtay aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke gharon mein us dauran aag na Jalti thi mein ne kaha ke Ae khala ! phir Aap ki zindagi kis par thi unhon ne kaha ke khajoor aur pani albatta Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke Ansaar mein se kuch hamsaye thay jin ke doodh walay janwar thay wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye doodh bhejtay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam wo doodh hamein bhi pila detay thay"
"2071","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki wafaat ho gayi aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam roti aur zaitoon ke tail se aik din mein do baar sair nahi hue (yani subah aur shaam donon waqt sair ho kar nahi khaya)"
"2072","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki aal do din tak gandum ki roti se sair nahi hui magar aik din sirf khajoor mili"
"2073","[AI-translation] ´Hazim kehtay hain ke` mein ne Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ko dekha ke wo apni donon ungliyon se baar ishara kartay thay aur kehtay ke qasam us ki jis ke haath mein Abu Huraira ki jaan hai ! Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ghar walay kabhi teen din pay dar pay gandum ki roti se sair nahi hue yahan tak ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam duniya se tashreef le gaye"
"2074","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne wafaat paayi aur mere daanon ke bartan mein thoray se jo thay usi mein se khaya karti thi yahan tak ke bohat din guzar gaye (phir) mein ne un ko maapa to wo khatm ho gaye (maloom hua ke majhool aur mubham shay mein barkat zyada hoti hai)"
"2075","[AI-translation] ´Simaak bin Harb kehtay hain ke` mein ne Numan bin Bashir (raziyallahu anhu) ko khutba padhtay hue suna wo keh rahay thay ke Umar raziyallahu anhu ne us (maal o daulat) ka zikr kiya jo log hasil kar rahay thay aur phir ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam saara din bhook se beqaraar rehtay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko naaqis khajoor bhi na milti jis se apna pait bhar lein"
"2076","[AI-translation] ´Abu Abdur Rahman Hubli kehtay hain ke` mein ne Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhu) se suna aur un se aik shakhs ne poocha ke kiya ham faqeer Muhajireen mein se nahi hain Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke teri biwi hai jis ke paas to rehta hai wo bola ke haan hai Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke tera ghar hai jis mein to rehta hai wo bola ke haan hai Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke to ameeron mein se hai wo bola ke mere paas aik khadim bhi hai Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke phir to to badshahon mein se hai Abu Abdur Rahman ne kaha ke teen aadmi Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaye aur mein un ke paas maujood tha wo kehnay lagay ke Ae Muhammad ! Allah ki qasam ! hamein koi cheez mayassar nahi na kharch na sawaari aur na asbaab Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke tum jo chaho mein karun agar chahtay ho to hamaray paas chalay aao ham tumhein wo dein ge jo Allah ne tumhari taqdeer mein likha hai aur agar kaho to ham tumhara zikr baadshah se karein aur agar chaho to sabr karo us liye ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke mohtaaj Muhajireen maaldaaron se chaalees baras pehle (jannat mein) jayein ge wo bolay ke ham sabr kartay hain aur kuch nahi maango"
"2077","[AI-translation] ´Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein jannat ke darwazay par khara hua wahan dekha to us ke andar aksar wo log hain jo (duniya mein) miskeen hain aur ameer maaldaar log (hisab o kitab ke liye) rokay gaye hain (jabke faqr ki zindagi guzaarnay walay momin to baghair hisab o kitab jannat mein ja chukay hun ge) aur jo dozakhi hain un ko to dozakh mein janay ka hukm ho chuka aur mein ne dozakh ke darwazay par khara ho kar dekha to wahan aurtein zyada hain"
"2078","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bazaar mein se guzray aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kisi Aaliya ki taraf se Madina mein aa rahay thay aur log Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke aik taraf ya donon taraf thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik chotay kaanon wala ya kate hue kaanon wala bheer ka bacha dekha jo ke mara hua tha Aap ne us ka kaan pakra phir farmaya ke tum mein se ye aik dirham mein kaun leta hai logon ne kaha ke ham aik dirham mein bhi us ko lena nahi chahtay (yani kisi cheez ke badlay) aur ham us ko kiya karein ge Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum chahtay ho ke ye tumhein mil jaye logon ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! agar ye zinda hota tab bhi us mein aib tha ke us ke kaan bohat chotay hain phir ye to murda hai us ko kaun le ga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah ki qasam ! duniya Allah ke qareeb us se bhi zyada zaleel hai jaisay ye tumharay qareeb hai"
"2079","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : duniya momin ke liye qaid khana hai aur kafir ki jannat hai"
"2080","[AI-translation] ´Amr bin Auf raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Abu Ubaida bin Jarraah raziyallahu anhu ko Bahrain ki taraf wahan ka jizya lenay ko bheja aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Bahrain walon se sulah kar li thi aur un par Ala' bin Hazrami raziyallahu anhu ko haakim muqarrar kiya tha phir Abu Ubaida raziyallahu anhu wo maal Bahrain se le kar aaye ye khabar Ansaar ko pahunchi to unhon ne Fajr ki namaz Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath padhi jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz se farigh ho kar phiray to Ansaar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay aa gaye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko dekh kar tabassum farmaya aur farmaya ke mein samajhta hun ke tum ne suna ke Abu Ubaida ke Bahrain se kuch maal le kar aanay ka sun liya hai (aur tum usi khayal se aaj jama hue ke maal milay ga) unhon ne kaha ke beshak Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke khush ho jao aur us baat ki umeed rakho jis se tum khush hotay ho pas Allah ki qasam ! mujhe tum par faqeeri ka darr nahi lekin mujhe us ka darr hai ke duniya tum par kushaada ho jaye gi jaisay tum se pehle logon par kushaada hui thi phir aik doosray se zyada shauq karnay lago jaisay aglay logon ne shauq kiya tha aur wo (shauq ya wo duniya) tumhein halaak kar de jaisay us ne un logon ko halaak kiya tha"
"2081","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab Faris aur Room fatah ho jayein ge to tum kiya kaho ge Abdur Rahman bin Auf raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke ham wohi kahein ge jo Allah ne hamein hukm kiya (yani us ka shukr ada karein ge) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke aur kuch nahi kehtay rashk karo ge phir hasad karo ge phir doston se bigaaro ge phir dushmani karo ge ya aisa hi kuch farmaya phir miskeen Muhajireen ke paas jao ge aur aik ko doosron ka haakim banao ge"
"2082","[AI-translation] ´Mastoor Akhi Bani Fihr kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah ki qasam duniya aakhirat ke saamnay aisay hai jaisay tum mein se koi ye ungli darya mein daalay (aur Yahya ne apni shahadat ki ungli se ishara kiya) phir dekhay ke kitni tari darya mein se lata hai (to jitna pani ungli mein laga rehta hai wo goya duniya hai aur wo darya aakhirat hai ye nisbat duniya ko aakhirat se hai aur chunke duniya faani hai aur aakhirat daa'imi baaqi hai us wastay us se bhi kam hai)"
"2083","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke Bani Israil ke logon mein teen aadmi thay aik korhi safed daagh wala doosra ganja aur teesra andha pas Allah Taala ne un ko aazmaana chaha ke to un ke paas farishta bheja pas wo safed daagh walay ke paas aaya aur us ne kaha ke tujhe kaun si cheez bohat pyaari hai us ne kaha ke acha rang achi khaal aur mujh se ye beemari door ho jaye jis ke sabab se log mujh se nafrat kartay hain Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke farishtay ne us par haath phera pas us ki badsoorti door ho gayi aur us ko acha rang aur achi khaal di gayi farishtay ne kaha ke tujhe kaun sa maal bohat pasand hai us ne kaha ke oont ya gaaye (rawi hadees Ishaaq bin Abdullah ko shak hai ke us ne oont maanga ya gaaye lekin safed daagh walay ya ganjay ne un mein se aik ne oont kaha aur doosray ne gaaye) pas us ko das maheena ki gaabhan oontni di aur kaha ke Allah Taala tere wastay us mein barkat de Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir farishta ganjay ke paas aaya pas kaha ke tujhe kaun si cheez bohat pasand hai us ne kaha ke achay baal aur ye beemari jati rahay jis ke sabab se log mujh se nafrat kartay hain phir us ne us par haath phera to us ki beemari door ho gayi aur us ko achay baal milay farishtay ne kaha ke tujhe kaun sa maal bohat pasand hai us ne kaha ke gaaye pas us ko gaabhan gaaye de di gayi farishtay ne kaha ke Allah Taala tere maal mein barkat de Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir farishta andhay ke paas aaya aur kaha ke tujhe kaun si cheez bohat pasand hai us ne kaha ke Allah Taala aankh mein bainayi kar de to mein us ke sabab se logon ko dekhon Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir farishtay ne us par haath phera to Allah ne us ko bainayi de di farishtay ne kaha ke tujhe kaun sa maal bohat pasand hai us ne kaha ke bheer bakri to us ko gaabhan bakri mili phir un donon (oontni aur gaaye) aur us (bakri) ne bachay diye phir hotay hotay safed daagh walay ke jungle bhar oont ho gaye aur ganjay ke jungle bhar gaaye bail ho gaye aur andhay ke jungle bhar bakriyan ho gayein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke muddat ke baad wohi farishta safed daagh walay ke paas us ki pehli soorat aur shakal mein aaya aur kaha ke mein mohtaaj aadmi hun safar mein mere tamam asbaab kat gaye (yani tadbeerein jati rahein aur maal aur asbaab na raha) pas aaj mere liye Allah ki madad ke siwa aur us ke baad teri madad ke baghair manzil par pahunchna mumkin nahi hai mein tujh se us ke naam par jis ne tujhe suthra rang aur suthri khaal di aur maal oont diye aik oont maangta hun jo mere safar mein kaam aaye us ne kaha ke mujh par logon ke bohat haq hain (yani qarzdar hun ya gharbaar ke kharch se zyada maal nahi jo tujhe dun) phir farishta ne kaha ke albatta mein tujhe pehchanta hun bhala kiya to mohtaaj korhi na tha ke log tujh se nafrat kartay thay phir Allah ne apne fazl se tujhe ye maal diya us ne jawab diya ke mein ne to ye maal apne baap dada se paya hai jo kai pusht se naqal ho kar aaya hai farishtay ne kaha ke agar to jhoota ho to Allah tujhe waisa hi kar daalay jaisa to pehle tha Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir farishta ganjay ke paas us ki pehli soorat aur shakal mein aaya aur us se waisa hi kaha jaisa safed daagh walay se kaha tha aur us ne bhi wohi jawab diya jo safed daagh walay ne diya tha farishtay ne kaha ke agar to jhoota ho to Allah tujhe waisa hi kar daalay jaisa to tha Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir farishta andhay ke paas us ki pehli shakal o soorat mein gaya aur kaha ke mein mohtaaj aadmi hun aur musafir hun mere safar mein mere sab waseelay aur tadbeerein kat gayein pas mujhe aaj manzil par Allah ki madad aur us ke baad teri madad ke baghair pahunchna mushkil hai pas mein tujh se us Allah ke naam par jis ne tujhe bainayi di aik bakri maangta hun taake wo mere safar mein kaam aaye us ne kaha ke beshak mein andha tha to Allah ne mujhe (bainayi wali) aankh di to un bakriyon mein se jitni chaho le jao aur jitni chaho chhor jao Allah ki qasam ! aaj jo cheez to Allah ki raah mein le ga mein tujhe mushkil mein na daalun ga (yani tera haath na pakaron ga) pas farishtay ne kaha ke apna maal apne paas rakho tum teenon aadmi sirf aazmaaye gaye thay pas tujh se to Allah Taala raazi hua aur tere donon saathiyon se naakhush hua"
"2084","[AI-translation] ´Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Allah ki qasam ! mein wo pehla shakhs hun jis ne Allah ki raah mein teer maara aur ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath jihad kartay thay aur hamaray paas khanay ko kuch na hota magar Jale hue pattay aur babool (ye donon junglei darakht hain) yahan tak ke ham mein se koi aisa pakhana karta jaisay bakri karti hai phir aaj Banu Asad ke log (yani Zubair raziyallahu anhu ki aulad) mujhe deen ke liye tanbeeh kartay hain ya saza dena chahtay hain aisa ho to mein bilkul khusaray mein para aur meri mehnat zaya ho gayi"
"2085","[AI-translation] ´Khalid bin Umair adwa kehtay hain ke` (ameer Basra) Utba bin Ghazwaan raziyallahu anhu ne hamein khutba diya to Allah Taala ki hamd o sana ke baad kaha ke baad hamd o salat ke maloom ho ke duniya ne khatm honay ki khabar di aur duniya mein se kuch baaqi na raha magar jaisay bartan mein kuch bacha hua pani reh jata hai jis ko us ka saahib peeta hai aur tum duniya se aisay ghar ko janay walay ho jis ko zawaal nahi pas apni zindagi mein naik amal kar ke jao us liye ke ham se bayan kiya gaya ke pathar jahannam ke upar ke kinaaray se daalnay jaye ga aur satr baras tak us mein utarta jaye ga aur us ki teh ko na pahunche ga Allah ki qasam ! jahannam bhari jaye gi kiya tum taajjub kartay ho aur ham se bayan kiya gaya ke jannat ke darwazay ki aik taraf se le kar doosri taraf kinaaray tak chaalees baras ki raah hai aur aik din aisa aaye ga ke darwaza logon ke hujoom se bhara hua ho ga aur mein apne Aap ko dekh raha hun ke mein saat shakhson mein se saatwaan shakhs tha jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath thay aur hamara khana darakht ke patton ke siwa kuch na tha yahan tak ke hamari baachhein zakhmi ho gayein (bawaja patton ki haraarat aur sakhti ke) mein ne aik chaadar paayi aur us ko phaar kar do tukray kiye aik tukray ka mein ne tehband banaya aur doosray tukray ka Sa'd bin Maalik ne ab aaj ke roz koi ham mein se aisa nahi hai ke kisi sheher ka haakim na ho aur mein us baat se Allah ki panah maangta hun ke mein apne Aap ko bara samajhon lekin Allah ke qareeb chota hun aur beshak kisi paighambar ki nabuwwat (duniya mein) hamesha nahi rahi balke nabuwwat ka asar (thori muddat mein) jata raha yahan tak ke us ka aakhri anjaam ye hua ke wo saltanat ho gayi pas anqareeb tum hamaray baad aanay walay umara ko dekho ge aur tajriba karo ge un ameeron ka jo hamaray baad aayein ge (ke un mein deen ki baatein jo nabuwwat ka asar hai na rahein gi aur wo bilkul duniyadaar ho jayein ge)"
"2086","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : murday ke saath teen cheezein (qabristaan mein) jati hain phir do laut aati hain aur aik reh jati hai us ke saath us ke ghar walay aur maal aur amal jatay hain sau ghar walay aur maal to laut aatay hain aur amal us ke saath reh jata hai (pas amal poori rifaqat karta hai usi ke liye insaan ko koshish karni chahiye baal bachay maal daulat ye sab jinay tak ke saath hain marnay ke baad kuch kaam ke nahi aur un mein dil lagana beaqli hai)"
"2087","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : us shakhs ko dekho jo tum se (maal aur daulat mein aur Hasan o jamaal mein aur baal bachon mein) kam hai aur us ko mat dekho jo (un cheezon mein) tum se zyada hai agar aisa karo ge to Allah Taala ki nemat ko apne upar haqeer na samjho ge"
"2088","[AI-translation] ´Amir bin Sa'd kehtay hain ke` Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) apne oonton mein thay ke un ka beta Umar aaya (ye Umar bin Sa'd wohi hai jo haseen raziyallahu anhu se lara aur jis ne duniya ke liye apni aakhirat barbaad ki) jab Sa'd raziyallahu anhu ne us ko dekha to kaha ke mein us sawaar ke shar se Allah Taala ki panah maangta hun phir wo utra aur bola ke tum apne oonton aur bakriyon mein utray ho aur logon ko chhor diya wo saltanat ke liye lar rahay hain (yani khilafat aur hukumat ke liye) Sa'd raziyallahu anhu ne us ke seena par maara aur kaha ke chup reh mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke Allah us banday ko dost rakhta hai jo parhezgaar hai maaldaar hai aur (fitnay fasaad ke waqt) aik konay mein chhupa baitha hai (aur apna iman nahi bigaarta afsos hai ke Umar bin Sa'd ne apne baap ki nasihat ko faraamosh kiya)"
"2089","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Allah Taala farmata hai ke mein aur shareekon ki nisbat shirk se bohat zyada beparwa hun jis ne koi aisa amal kiya jis mein mere saath mere ghair ko bhi milaya aur saajhi kiya to mein us ko aur us ke saajhi ke kaam ko chhor deta hun (yani jo ibadat aur amal dikhanay aur shohrat ke wastay ho wo Allah ke qareeb maqbool nahi mardood hai Allah usi ibadat aur amal ko qabool karta hai jo Allah hi ke wastay khaalis ho doosray ka us mein kuch hissa na ho)"
"2090","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo shakhs logon ko sunanay ke liye naik kaam karay ga Allah Taala bhi qayamat ke din us ki zillat logon ko sunaye ga aur jo shakhs riyaakaari karay ga Allah Taala bhi us ko (sirf sawab) dikhlaaye ga (magar de ga nahi taake usay sirf hasrat hi hasrat ho)"
"2091","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : banda aisi baat keh baithta hai jis ki barayi ka usay andaza nahi hota aur us ki wajah se aag mein itna utar jata hai jaisay mashriq se Maghrib tak (jaisay kisi Musalman ki shikayat ya mukhbari hukmraanon ke saamnay ya tohmat ya gaali ya kufr ka kalima Ae Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ya Quran ya shariat ke saath mazaaq pas insaan ko chahiye ke zubaan ko qaabu mein rakhay aur baghair zaroorat baat na karay)"
"2092","[AI-translation] ´Suhaib raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : momin ka bhi ajab haal hai us ke har ma'amlay mein bhalayi hi bhalayi hai aur ye baat siwae momin ke kisi ko hasil nahi hai agar us ko khushi hasil hui aur us ne shukr ada kiya to us mein bhi sawab hai aur jo us ko nuqsan pahuncha aur us par sabr kiya to us mein bhi sawab hai"
"2093","[AI-translation] ´Suhaib raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum se pehle logon mein aik baadshah tha aur us ka aik jadugar tha jab wo jadugar boorha ho gaya to baadshah se bola ke mein boorha ho gaya hun mere paas koi larka bhej ke mein us ko jadu sikhalaoon baadshah ne us ke paas aik larka bheja wo us ko jadu sikhlaata tha us larkay ki aamad-o-raft ki raah mein aik raahib tha (eesaa'i darwesh yani paadri taarik ad-dunya) wo larka us ke paas baitha aur us ka kalaam suna to usay us ki baatein achi lagein ab jadugar ke paas jata to raahib ki taraf se ho kar nikalta aur us ke paas baithta phir jab jadugar ke paas jata to jadugar us ko (dair se aanay ki wajah se) maarta aakhir larkay ne jadugar ke maarnay ka raahib se galla kiya to raahib ne kaha ke jab to jadugar se darre to ye keh diya kar ke mere ghar walon ne mujh ko rok rakha tha aur jab to apne ghar walon se darre to keh diya kar ke jadugar ne mujhe rok rakha tha usi haalat mein wo larka raha ke achanak aik baray darinday par guzra ke jis ne logon ko aamad-o-raft se rok rakha tha larkay ne kaha ke aaj mein maloom karta hun ke jadugar afzal hai ya raahib afzal hai us ne aik pathar liya aur kaha ke ilaahi agar raahib ka tareeqa tujhe jadugar ke tareeqay se zyada pasand ho to us janwar ko qatl kar taake log guzar jayein phir us ko pathar se maara to wo janwar mar gaya aur log guzarnay lagay phir wo larka raahib ke paas aaya us se ye haal kaha to wo bola ke beta to mujh se barh gaya hai yaqeenan tera rutba yahan tak pahuncha jo mein dekhta hun aur to anqareeb aazmaya jaye ga phir agar to aazmaya jaye to mera naam na batlana us larkay ka ye haal tha ke andhay aur korhi ko acha karta aur har qasam ki beemari ka ilaaj karta tha ye haal jab baadshah ke musaahib jo ke andha ho gaya tha suna to us larkay ke paas bohat se tohfay laya aur kehnay laga ke ye sab maal tera hai agar to mujhe acha kar de larkay ne kaha ke mein kisi ko acha nahi karta acha karna to Allah Taala ka kaam hai agar to Allah par iman laaye to mein Allah se dua karun ga to wo tujhe acha kar de ga wo wazeer Allah par iman laya to Allah ne us ko acha kar diya wo baadshah ke paas gaya aur us ke paas baitha jaisa ke baitha karta tha baadshah ne kaha ke teri aankh kis ne roshan ki wazeer bola ke mere Maalik ne baadshah ne kaha ke mere siwa tera Maalik kaun hai wazeer ne kaha ke mera aur tera Maalik Allah hai baadshah ne us ko pakra aur azaab shuru kiya yahan tak ke us ne larkay ka naam le liya wo larka bulaya gaya baadshah ne us se kaha ke Ae beta to jadu mein us darja par pahuncha ke andhay aur korhi ko acha karta hai aur baray baray kaam karta hai wo bola ke mein to kisi ko acha nahi karta balke Allah acha karta hai baadshah ne us ko pakra aur maarta raha yahan tak ke us ne raahib ka naam batlaya raahib pakar liya gaya us se kaha gaya ke apne deen se phir ja us ke na maannay par baadshah ne aik aara mangwaya aur raahib ki maang par rakh kar us ko cheer daalnay yahan tak ke do tukray ho kar gir para phir wo wazeer bulaya gaya us se kaha gaya ke to apne deen se phir ja us ne bhi na maana us ki maang par bhi aara rakha gaya aur cheer daalnay yahan tak ke do tukray ho kar gir para phir wo larka bulaya gaya us se kaha ke apne deen se palat ja us ne bhi na inkar kiya ne us ko apne chand saathiyon ke hawalay kiya aur kaha ke us ko falan pahar par le ja kar choti par charhao jab tum choti par pahuncho to us larkay se poocho agar wo apne deen se phir jaye to khair nahi to us ko dhakail do wo us ko le gaye aur pahar par charhaya larkay ne dua ki ke ilaahi jis tarah to chahay mujhe un ke shar se bacha pahar hila aur wo log gir paray wo larka baadshah ke paas chala aaya baadshah ne poocha ke tere saathi kahan gaye us ne kaha ke Allah ne mujhe un ke shar se bacha liya phir baadshah ne us ko apne chand saathiyon ke hawalay kiya aur kaha ke us ko aik kashti mein darya ke andar le jao agar apne deen se phir jaye to khair warna us ko darya mein dhakail dena wo log us ko le gaye larkay ne kaha ke ilaahi ! to mujhe jis tarah chahay un ke shar se bacha le wo kashti aundhi ho gayi aur larkay ke siwa sab saathi doob gaye aur larka zinda bach kar baadshah ke paas aa gaya baadshah ne us se poocha ke tere saathi kahan gaye wo bola ke Allah Taala ne mujhe un ke shar se bacha liya phir larkay ne baadshah se kaha ke to mujhe us waqt tak na maar sakay ga jab tak ke jo tareeqa mein batlaun wo na karay baadshah ne kaha ke wo kiya us ne kaha ke to sab logon ko aik maidaan mein jama kar ke mujhe aik lakri par sooli de phir mere tarkash se aik teer le kar kamaan ke andar rakh phir keh ke us Allah ke naam se maarta hun jo us larkay ka Maalik hai phir teer maar agar to aisa karay ga to mujhe qatl karay ga baadshah ne sab logon ko aik maidaan mein jama kiya us larkay ko darakht ke tanay par latkaya phir us ke tarkash mein se aik teer liya aur teer ko kamaan ke andar rakh kar ye kehtay hue maara ke Allah ke naam se maarta hun jo us larkay ka Maalik hai wo teer larkay ki kanpati par laga us ne apna haath teer ke muqaam par rakha aur mar gaya logon ne ye haal dekh kar kaha ke ham to us larkay ke Maalik par iman laaye ham us larkay ke Maalik par iman laaye ham us larkay ke Maalik par iman laaye kisi ne baadshah se kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! jis se to darta tha wohi hua yani log iman le aaye baadshah ne raston ke naalon par Khandaqein khodnay ka hukm diya phir Khandaqein khodi gayein aur un mein khoob aag bharkayi gayi aur kaha ke jo shakhs us deen se (yani larkay ke deen se) na phiray usay un Khandaqon mein dhakail do ya us se kaha jaye ke un Khandaqon mein gire logon ne aisa hi kiya yahan tak ke aik aurat aayi jis ke saath us ka bacha bhi tha wo aurat aag mein girnay se jhijhki (peechay hati) to bachay ne kaha ke Ae maan ! sabr kar to sache deen par hai (marnay ke baad phir chain hi chain hai phir to duniya ki museebat se kyun darrti hai Nawawi rahimahullah Allah ne kaha ke us hadees se auliya ki karaamaat saabit hoti hain aur ye bhi nikalta hai ke zaroorat ke waqt jhoot bolna durust hai aur usi tarah maslihat ke liye)"
